            <fr:route>/ffi/sec-symplectic/</fr:route>
            <fr:title text="finite-field-invariants: a reference forest › The symplectic skeleton"><fr:link href="/ffi/index/" title="finite-field-invariants: a reference forest" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/index/" display-uri="index" type="local">finite-field-invariants: a reference forest</fr:link> › The symplectic skeleton</fr:title>
          </fr:frontmatter>
          <fr:mainmatter>
            <html:p>One idea at three scales. Avatar 1 is global, avatar 2 semi-local,
  avatar 3 infinitesimal; the thesis is that each is the same statement
  about half an orbit dimension.</html:p>
            <html:ul><html:li><fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0011/" title="The trace form" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0011/" display-uri="ffi-0011" type="local">The trace form</fr:link> — the pairing everything is measured
    in.</html:li>
    <html:li><fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0012/" title="The three recurring numbers" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0012/" display-uri="ffi-0012" type="local">The three numbers</fr:link> — centralizer, orbit, and the
    half.</html:li>
    <html:li><fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0013/" title="The thesis: every bound is half an orbit dimension" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0013/" display-uri="ffi-0013" type="local">The thesis</fr:link> — the thesis, and the three avatars.</html:li>
    <html:li><fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0014/" title="Orbital varieties are Lagrangian" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0014/" display-uri="ffi-0014" type="local">Orbital varieties are Lagrangian</fr:link> — avatar 1,
    proven.</html:li>
    <html:li><fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0015/" title="Nilpotent pencils, drop points, the centralizer sheaf" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0015/" display-uri="ffi-0015" type="local">The pencil apparatus</fr:link> — the semi-local apparatus.</html:li>
    <html:li><fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0016/" title="(H1): the incidence theorem for flagless pencils" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0016/" display-uri="ffi-0016" type="local">(H1)</fr:link> — avatar 2, proven.</html:li>
    <html:li><fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0049/" title="The germ apparatus" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0049/" display-uri="ffi-0049" type="local">The germ apparatus</fr:link> — avatar 3, the germ apparatus.</html:li>
    <html:li><fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0017/" title="Wall 1: coisotropy of the cyclic cocycle" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0017/" display-uri="ffi-0017" type="local">Wall 1</fr:link> — the bottom floor of the tower.</html:li>
    <html:li><fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0051/" title="The anomaly law" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0051/" display-uri="ffi-0051" type="local">The anomaly law</fr:link> — why characteristic 2.</html:li></html:ul>
          </fr:mainmatter>
        </fr:tree>
      </fr:mainmatter>
